OL,3,GNEWSAHow AI is making life easier for
OL,4,Asocial workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial workers in adult social care in
OL,7,FSuffolk will be using Artificial
OL,8,FIntelligence (AI)  tools in their case
OL,9,Fwork, following a successful pilot.
OL,11,FTraining for the technology, which
OL,12,Frecords and transcribes social workers'
OL,13,Fassessments, will be rolled out to all
OL,14,Fpractitioners over the coming months,
OL,15,Faccording to Suffolk County Council.
OL,17,FJamie Stewart, transformation manager
OL,18,Ffor practice and culture at the council
OL,19,Fsaid: "Practitioners still review the
OL,20,Finformation gathered and then use their
OL,21,Fprofessional judgement to record their
OL,22,Fdecision. "
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
