OL,3,GNEWSAHow AI is making life easier for
OL,4,Asocial workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Jo Finch, professor of social work
OL,7,Fat University of Suffolk, has cautioned
OL,8,Fthat AI tools must not lead to "cutting
OL,9,Fcorners" or using AI to do analysis.
